      return '<section class="portal-edit-section custom-fabric-selection-section sportswear-item-selection-section"><header><div><b>Sportswear types, fabrics & qualities</b><small>All options are selected by default. Deselect any type, fabric or quality that this Sportswear design should not offer. Fabric rates below are the Round Neck base rates; the selected type adjustment is calculated automatically for customers.</small></div></header><fieldset><div class="sportswear-item-option-heading"><b>Types</b><small>Choose which garment types customers can select.</small></div><div class="item-fabric-selection-grid sportswear-item-type-grid">'+typeCards+'</div><div class="sportswear-item-option-heading"><b>Fabrics & qualities</b><small>Choose allowed fabrics and qualities. Rates work the same way as the T-Shirt selection.</small></div><div class="item-fabric-selection-grid">'+fabricCards+'</div></fieldset></section>';
